     "body": "Lovable's designer has shipped 'like I think 130 PRs'; a button fix went from problem to merged in about '10 minutes'. Claude Code's design lead says 'more than half of my code' now comes through Claude in Slack. Intercom engineers often say 'I can use 80% of that' about a coded prototype PR. At Shopify a prototype 'has given 80% to the developer', and a few days of work per version became a few hours.",
